--- !u!114 &565306262
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 565306261}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9f38a12282883754fa1bb076a8c463bc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Allara
      line: Wait why is there only one page in here??
    - character:
        name: Allara
      line: Oh no... the rest of them must have been swept up in that storm! They
        could be anywhere by now!
    - character:
        name: Allara
      line: Alright, come on Allara. Calm down. You may have been in what looked
        like a world-ending storm just now... but everything seems fine... at least
        for now.
    - character:
        name: Allara
      line: Although this purple vortex-looking thing tearing open the world in front
        of me could say otherwise...
    - character:
        name: Allara
      line: There's no way I'll be able to get past this thing with only a measly
        Slash... and live. I can feel the air getting sucked in even from here.
    - character:
        name: Allara
      line: Hmm... maybe there's another way I can get around it down this other
        path?
